  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scientific Cooperation Research Program - Affordable and Efficient Hydroponic or Aeroponic Crop Production Technology for Small-Scale Producers in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Scientific Cooperation Research Program supports joint research, extension, and education projects lasting up to two years among domestic and international agricultural professionals. These projects address issues including agricultural trade and market access, animal and plant health, biotechnology, food safety and security, and sustainable natural resource management.</narrative>
